graph TB
  T["Type hints are NOT enforced at run time.<br/>Nothing checks them. mypy is a linter."]

  T --> G1["Where that is fine:<br/>your own function signatures,<br/>caught by mypy in CI"]
  T --> G2["Where it is NOT fine:<br/>data crossing a boundary —<br/>an HTTP body, a model's output,<br/>a config file"]

  G2 --> P["Pydantic fills the gap:<br/>validation at run time,<br/>plus a JSON Schema"]

  P --> U1["tool argument schemas<br/><i>Chapter 6</i>"]
  P --> U2["structured output<br/><i>Chapter 6</i>"]
  P --> U3["settings and config<br/><i>this chapter</i>"]
  P --> U4["API request and response<br/><i>Chapter 13</i>"]

  N["TypedDict is the exception: LangGraph<br/>state uses it because state is a plain<br/>dict the runtime merges, not an object<br/>it constructs. Chapter 8."]

  P -.- N

  classDef n fill:#F4F6F8,stroke:#1F4E79
  classDef warn fill:#FBE9E9,stroke:#9B2C2C
  classDef good fill:#E8F4F0,stroke:#0E7C7B,stroke-width:2px
  classDef note fill:#FDF3E0,stroke:#B26A00,color:#5A5A5A
  class T,G1,U1,U2,U3,U4 n
  class G2 warn
  class P good
  class N note
